    "body": "For accessibility purposes, there are probably scenarios where you'll *have to* offer a way to pause the video. Will `<img>` tags now have a JS `.pause()` method?\r\n\r\nFrom WCAG 2.1, potential friction point if an image can't be paused: [2.2.2 Pause, Stop, Hide](https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG21/#pause-stop-hide).",
