    "body": "@kornelski this solution is being debated as \r\n- an improvement over GIFs, in which case, we already have accessibility issues, and file size improvements would be better than nothing\r\n- but also as a crutch for the removal of the `media` attribute in video `<source>` tags (which still exists in the picture `<source>` tags), in which case we would be losing accessibility features",
