    "created_at": "2021-10-03T11:45:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-03T11:45:11Z",
    "body": "@jonsneyers the `media` attribute has **already** been removed from video `<source>` tags. So at this point, we have no clean way of doing responsive videos for above-the-fold content. If `<picture>` starts to support video content, developers are going to flock to this solution for the use-case of *responsive above-the-fold videos*.\r\n\r\nSo in my opinion, this change should either land with accessibility in mind, or land at the same time as some changes to the `<video>` tag that solve the *responsive above-the-fold videos* use-case.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
